get_editable_animation_list()` is meant to be called only from the main thread because it boils down to a function in some editor plugin (and editor APIs are in general meant to be used from the main thread only). Instead of `is_current_thread_safe_for_nodes()`,, you want to use `Thread::is_main_thread()`. The former worls because the main thread happens to be safe-for-nodes, but both checks aren't conceptually (nor practically) equivalent.","created_at":"2025-02-11T13:05:47Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T13:05:48Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102692#discussion_r1950821944","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102692","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1950821944"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102692#discussion_r1950821944"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102692"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1950821944/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":84,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1950529679,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":7,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1951454849","pull_request_review_id":2609788637,"id":1951454849,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc50UNaB","diff_hunk":"@@ -79,7 +79,11 @@ AnimationNode::NodeTimeInfo AnimationNodeAnimation::get_node_time_info() const {\n \n void AnimationNodeAnimation::_validate_property(PropertyInfo &p_property) const {\n \tif (p_property.name == \"animation\" && get_editable_animation_list) {\n-\t\tVector<String> names = get_editable_animation_list();\n+\t\tVector<String> names;\n+\t\t// Prevents off-main-thread errors when generating resource previews.\n+\t\ti